==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Deploy Limit}}

==Battleground==
*8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*6 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similar to [[Attack of the Omens]], this is an Aku stage with Johnnyleon that you want to treat as a stepping stone. Use [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island]] for the Ginger Snaches, while using [[Courier Cat]] to do damage against everything here, particularly the St. Pigge. For the Aku enemies, [[Barrel Cat]]'s LD and Shield Pierce abilities help very well for Fallen Bear. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] is, as per usual is, cracked when dealing with the majority of aku threats. Generally, you want high health meatshields that don't clog up your cat limit like [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]].

